  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "d11-page-1",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "d11-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Fjord Analytics — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Fjord Analytics — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Fjord Analytics closed Q3 2025 with two platform migrations and a reorganisation of the support function. As a company focused on supply-chain forecasting, the leadership team tracked regional performance, headcount, pricing, service levels and vendor spend against the annual plan, all of which are detailed in the sections that follow.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Checkout platform is owned by the Core Services team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Ibrahim Sow, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 80.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Management notes that comparisons to the prior year are affected by the change in revenue recognition adopted at the start of the fiscal year.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 104.6
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 122.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d11-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Regional results are reported in constant currency. Revenue reflects recognised subscription and services revenue; growth is quarter-over-quarter; churn is logo churn measured at renewal; NPS is the trailing 90-day relationship score.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 136.9
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
